From: =?UTF-8?q?K=C3=A9vin=20R=C3=A9mondi=C3=A8re?= <kevin@localhost>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 13:15:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 37/57] vulkan: coopmat1 FA prefill stack (P-hoist + Psh
 query-major), ported from Nathanw1014
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- hoist GEMM2 P-fragment coopMatLoad out of the hsv_tile loop (e11cafa02)
- store Psh query-major so the GEMM2 A load vectorizes, LDS 16384->15360B (40f85eb85)
- host shmem estimator updated to the new Psh layout
- GGML_VK_FA_FORCE/GGML_VK_FA_TUNING env overrides (prefill regime only, n_rows>=128),
  with optional 5th subgroup_size field; GGML_VK_DEBUG_FA_TUNING print
- NOTE: Bc=32/rs=2 override measured faster (-11% FA) but FAILS backend
  correctness (test-backend-ops FLASH_ATTN_EXT) — rejected, kept default params

Microbench kv=131072 nb=2048 q8_0 (exact qwen4exp prefill shape): 1163 -> 1092 ms (-6.1%)
Prod prefill 81k nonce: 332.1 -> 321.8 s (-3.1%), toolcall greedy 3/3, France OK
---
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp          | 50 +++++++++++++++++--
 .../vulkan-shaders/flash_attn_cm1.comp        | 26 +++++++---
 2 files changed, 65 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp b/ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp
